          "type": "circumstance",
          "value": 2,
          "when": [
            "hive-mind",
            "mental"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Retributive Strike",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger An enemy damages the wereant sentinel's ally, and both are within 15 feet of the wereant sentinel\n\n---\nEffect The ally gains resistance 20 against the triggering damage. If the foe is within reach, the wereant sentinel makes a melee Strike against it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Change Shape",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "polymorph",
        "primal"
      ],
      "text": "The wereant changes into their humanoid, hybrid, or animal shape. Each shape has a specific, persistent appearance. A true wereant's natural form is their hybrid shape. In humanoid shape, they use their original humanoid size, lose their jaws and claw Strikes, and gain a melee fist Strike that deals bludgeoning damage equal to the slashing damage dealt by their mandibles. In animal shape, they take the form of a Medium giant ant, gain a climb Speed of 20 feet, gain Grab on their mandibles Strike, and lose their weapon Strikes.\n\n---",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "unsupported",
          "foundry": {
            "alwaysActive": true,
            "key": "RollOption",
            "label": "PF2E.NPCAbility.ChangeShape.Label",
            "option": "change-shape",
            "selection": "hybrid",
            "suboptions": [
              {
                "label": "PF2E.NPCAbility.ChangeShape.Form.Hybrid",
                "value": "hybrid"
              },
